    Protected Methodology & Concept:
    The methods, codebase, and overall conceptual framework—including the embedding of metadata using Base64 encoding for integrity—are proprietary and part of the Antwerp Designs ecosystem. These approaches are protected under Antwerp Designs licensing and are part of a network developed since 2023.

    About Metadata:
    This project enables secure, integrity-preserving embedding of metadata into images and data files using Base64 encoding. This ensures information about authorship, copyright, and context remains attached to digital works and is not easily removed without deliberate extraction—supporting creative rights, provenance, and digital trust.


